§§ `Section 91 -- Unauthorized possession of firearm, prohibited weapon or restricted weapon`

-- src:2058 | Unauthorized possession of firearm
-- src:2059 | 91 (1) Subject to subsection (4), every person commits an offence who possesses a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm or a non-restricted firearm without being the holder of
-- src:2060 | (a) a licence under which the person may possess it; and
-- src:2061 | (b) in the case of a prohibited firearm or a restricted firearm, a registration certificate for it.
@ref s 91(1) (src:2058-2061)
GIVEN `the kind of thing possessed` IS A `s 84(1) kind of thing`
      `the person possesses it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the holder of a licence under which the person may possess it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is the holder of a registration certificate for it` IS A BOOLEAN
      `s 91(4) subsections (1) and (2) do not apply to the person` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 91(1) the person commits an offence of unauthorized possession of a firearm` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `s 91(4) subsections (1) and (2) do not apply to the person` EQUALS JUST TRUE THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Subsections (1) and (2) do not apply to"
        IF NOT (`s 84(1) the kind of thing is a firearm` `the kind of thing possessed` AND `the person possesses it`) THEN JUST FALSE   -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "every person commits an offence who possesses a prohibited firearm, a restricted firearm or a non-restricted firearm" (an unmet element)
        IF `the person holds what the subsection requires` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "without being the holder of"
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
    WHERE
        -- without being the holder of (a) a licence under which the person may possess it; and (b) in the case of a prohibited firearm or a restricted firearm, a registration certificate for it
        `the person holds what the subsection requires` MEANS
                `the person is the holder of a licence under which the person may possess it`
            AND (`the kind of thing possessed` EQUALS `s 84(1) kind: a non-restricted firearm` OR `the person is the holder of a registration certificate for it`)

-- src:2062 | Unauthorized possession of prohibited weapon or restricted weapon
