-- src:2138 | (2) Every person who commits an offence under subsection (1)
-- src:2139 | (a) is guilty of an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term of not more than 14 years; or
-- src:2140 | (b) is guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction.
