    IF     `the person comes into possession of it by the operation of law`
       AND `the person lawfully disposes of it within a reasonable period after acquiring possession of it`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "does not apply to a person who comes into possession of anything referred to in that subsection by the operation of law and who lawfully disposes of it" (it says nothing of anyone else)

