§§ `Section 98.1 -- Robbery to steal firearm`

-- src:2161 | Robbery to steal firearm
-- src:2162 | 98.1 Every person who commits a robbery within the meaning of section 343 with intent to steal a firearm or in the course of which he or she steals a firearm commits an indictable offence and is liable to imprisonment for life.
@ref s 98.1 (src:2161-2162)
